    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h1&gt;
$$
\Psi = \iint \vec{B} \cdot d\vec{s}
$$&lt;p&gt;Magnetic Flux is the integral of Magnetic Strength $B$ in area $s$&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
